## ObjectType: Legal Entity

Fictional issuer, broker or investment manager in a declared business role. Identifiers are local synthetic codes, not regulatory LEIs.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| entity_id | Entity Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | entity_id |
| name | Name | string | Human-readable fictional business name with equivalent bilingual meaning. | name |
| entity_role | Entity Role | string | Declared issuer, broker or manager role. Investment management is represented by manager, not an invented investment_manager code. Allowed values: broker, issuer, manager. | entity_role |
| country | Country | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | country |
| sector | Sector | string | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | sector |
| is_synthetic | Is Synthetic | boolean | Named business attribute constrained by model-contract.json types and controlled vocabulary. | is_synthetic |

### Keys

Primary Keys: entity_id
Display Key: name
